// ~ALTERA_DCLK~	=>  Location: PIN_H1,	 I/O Standard: 2.5 V,	 Current Strength: Default
// ~ALTERA_DATA0~	=>  Location: PIN_H2,	 I/O Standard: 2.5 V,	 Current Strength: Default
